# Every knob at its limit on a loud sweep: P1 255 (dense), P2 255 (feedback 0.8, detune) with a held C5 freezing and
# thawing, then P1 0 and pan 0 (dry only) must still pass sound, and nothing may clip.
tempo 120
steps 48
tail 1
track fx1
input sweep 30 16000 0.9
preset 255 255 0 0 255 0 0 0 0 255 255 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
gain 1
transport 0 stop                 # sequencer stopped: the free cloud (sync.scn has the time lock)
note 4 C5 12 127
note 18 C3 1 127
param p1 0 24
param pan 0 40
expect sound 1 48
expect peak_below 0
